            "paragraph": "El Ni\u00f1o-Southern Oscillation (ENSO) is the preeminent mode of global internal climate variability. It leads to strong anomalies of the atmosphere-ocean energy budget not only in the tropical Pacific Ocean, but also on a global scale.",
