            "target_entity_type": "No_Country_Region",
            "paragraph": "Variability in OHC in association with ENSO and teleconnections to the tropical Atlantic are well-known (e.g. Enfield and Mayer 1997), but Mayer et al. (2014) were able to bring these aspects together into a quantitatively consistent energy budget framework (see Fig. 1 for a schematic of the described energy flows).",
